  "_doc": "Claude plan state (#344). Each case gives a reading (a claude_plan_usage_readings row, or null) and 'now'; expect is what claude_plan_usage.derive_state and summarize return. fresh_window_kinds lists the windows whose resets_at is after now, in reading order. Rules: a reading older than 24 h (strictly) is stale; a window is fresh only while resets_at > now; with no fresh weekly_all window the state is unknown; otherwise the worst fresh window decides: >= 100 exhausted, > 80 constrained, else available. Reset times in summary_line are shown in America/New_York as '%a %-I:%M %p'. Percentages are printed with no decimals; avoid .5 values, whose rounding differs between languages.",
